Bundled audio:
- sounds/{dawn,glass,felt,tape,harbour}/ are synthesised by tools/earcons/generate.py
  (part of this repository, same license).
- sounds/drums/kit/ are one-shots generated with the ElevenLabs sound-effects API
  from the text prompts listed in sounds/drums/manifest.json. They are AI-generated
  audio; see the README for details.

The source tree does not vendor third-party code. Fonts (Manrope, IBM Plex Mono)
are loaded from Google Fonts at runtime under their own licenses (SIL OFL 1.1).
